<title>SPAIN: WATER POLO-RESULTS FROM EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>WATER POLO-RESULTS FROM EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE, Spain 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the seventh day</p>
<p>of the European championships on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Women's 11th-12th place playoff</p>
<p>Czech Republic 9 Portugal 8 (2-2 2-1 4-2 1-3)</p>
<p>Women's 10th-11th place playoff</p>
<p>Yugoslavia 5 Britain 4 (1-2 1-2 2-0 1-0)</p>
<p>Women's quarterfinal</p>
<p> Russia 9 Germany 5 (1-1 3-2 3-1 2-1)</p>
</text>
